WEBVTT

00:09:58.969 --> 00:10:00.638
Who grew this food?

00:10:01.305 --> 00:10:02.681
Where was it grown?

00:10:02.681 --> 00:10:04.266
When was it grown?

00:10:04.308 --> 00:10:08.812
How many steps and stops did it make
before it got to your table?

00:10:08.854 --> 00:10:12.691
How much food waste was generated
because of this meal?

00:10:13.442 --> 00:10:16.403
Let your answers influence your next meal.

00:10:16.904 --> 00:10:19.573
The fact that you have a choice

00:10:19.573 --> 00:10:21.492
gives you privilege

00:10:21.533 --> 00:10:23.869
and also gives you a voice

00:10:23.911 --> 00:10:27.206
to demand that the solutions
to the food ecosystem

00:10:27.247 --> 00:10:30.000
align with what works
for people and planet.